        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>Takane</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We're here.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's wrong？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We're staying here together,
huh.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>....</Dialog>
          <Dialog>L-let's go in.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Y-yeah.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I'm getting nervous...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>If we keep staying over
together like this, won't
people think it's weird？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Weird... how？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well... because we're in
high school.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That doesn't matter. It's
not like we're doing
anything wrong, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes... yes, you're right.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah, let's go.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Front Desk</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Welcome. Welcome to Hotel
Onoya.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I have a reservation under
▲苗字▲...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Let's go, ▲高嶺＊＊▲.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Madam, allow me to take your
bags.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh... m-me!? Y-yes...
thank you very much.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, huh, ▲高嶺＊＊▲,
what's wrong？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>He suddenly called me
"madam"...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Haha. Guess we look like a
married couple, huh.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(▲高嶺＊＊▲'s bright red.
I'm embarrassed too, but I
don't mind it at all.)</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
