        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, the buffet should be
starting about now.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Takane</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, I hope the food is
good.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, I'm eating
shrimp！ Shrimp！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Geez, rushing is bad
manners.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Haha. Then let's head to the
dining hall.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay, let's go.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ahh, I'm stuffed.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Geez, people will hear you.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Front Desk</Dialog>
          <Dialog>How was your meal？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It was delicious. Thank you
for the meal.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Thank you very much.
Tomorrow's breakfast will be
in the same place, so please
come by when it's time.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, yes. Have you ever heard
the story of the legendary
beach？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A legendary beach？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes, there's an island
called Hatsushima that you
can reach by boat from Atami
Port.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>On it, there's a beach that
no one has ever reached.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And legend says couples who
pledge their love there will
be happy forever.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Sounds like something I've
heard before...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A well-matched married
couple like you might just
find it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>....</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I've kept you long enough.
Please enjoy your stay.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Haha, a legendary beach,
▲高嶺＊＊▲.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>How lovely...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Tomorrow, we're definitely
going to look for it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, y-yeah. Sure.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Well, if it makes
▲高嶺＊＊▲ happy, that's
fine.)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What should we do tomorrow？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I want to go back there
again.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>There... you mean the
beach？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes, it's a place full of
memories for us.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah, let's look for it
again...</Dialog>
